# Menus on a desktop window (tools/gen-plays.mjs; generated: do not edit): Help with the effective keys, Settings
# (the colorblind-safe palette on), Profile, Friends & scores, the Daily screen, a Practice run paused by Escape,
# Resume, the Hint key, then left to end in the results, and back to the title.
until 300 Relic Run
frames 30
click =Help
until 60 How to play
frames 10
expect ArrowLeft / A
save help
click =Back
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Settings
until 60 Open Options
frames 10
click =Colorblind-safe palette
frames 10
save settings
click =Back
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Profile
until 60 Student of the Ruins
frames 10
save profile
click =Back
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Friends
until 60 Friends & scores
frames 10
expect Offline - showing locally saved records.
save friends
click =Back
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Daily Challenge
until 60 Same course for every player today
frames 10
save daily
click =Back
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Open — Practice
until 60 Unranked. Restart freely
frames 10
click Run — Easy
frames 148
key KeyH 1
frames 1
save practice-hint
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave run
frames 10
save paused
click =Resume
until 2400 Run complete
frames 20
expect =Practice run - unranked.
save practice-results
click =Back to title
until 60 Daily Challenge
frames 10
click =Profile
until 60 Total runs
frames 10
save profile-after
